#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "QuantumCircuit gates {#quantumcircuit-gates}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following gate methods have been removed in favor of more established\n"
"methods that append the same gates:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Removed                      | Alternative |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.cnot`        | [`QuantumCircuit.cx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cx)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.toffoli`     | [`QuantumCircuit.ccx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#ccx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.fredkin`     | [`QuantumCircuit.cswap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#cswap) |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.mct`         | [`QuantumCircuit.mcx`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#mcx)     |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.i`           | [`QuantumCircuit.id`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#id)       |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.squ`         | [`QuantumCircuit.unitary`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#unitary) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following circuit methods have been removed. Instead, these gates can be\n"
"applied to a circuit with `QuantumCircuit.append`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Removed                      | Alternative (append) |\n"
"|------------------------------|----------------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.diagonal`    | [`DiagonalGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.DiagonalGate)          |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.hamiltonian` | [`HamiltonianGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.HamiltonianGate)    |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.isometry`    | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.iso`         | [`Isometry`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.Isometry)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.uc`          | [`UCGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCGate)               |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrx`        | [`UCRXGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRXGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucry`        | [`UCRYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRYGate)           |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.ucrz`        | [`UCRZGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.UCRZGate)           |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, for a "
"[`DiagonalGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.DiagonalGate):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following `QuantumCircuit` methods have also been removed:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Removed                          | Alternative |\n"
"|----------------------------------|-------------|\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.bind_parameters` | [`QuantumCircuit.assign_parameters`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#assign_parameters) |\n"
"| `QuantumCircuit.snapshot`        | `qiskit-aer`'s [save instructions](https://qiskit.org/ecosystem/aer/apidocs/circuit.html#saving-simulator-data) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.converters\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.converters {#qiskitconverters}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.converters.ast_to_dag` function has been removed from Qiskit. It converted the\n"
"abstract syntax tree generated by the legacy OpenQASM 2 parser to a\n"
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit). As the legacy\n"
"OpenQASM 2 parser has been removed (see [qiskit.qasm](#qiskit.qasm)), this\n"
"function no longer serves a purpose. Instead, parse your OpenQASM 2 files into\n"
"a `QuantumCircuit` using the\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.from_qasm_file`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#from_qasm_file)\n"
"or\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.from_qasm_str`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#from_qasm_str)\n"
"constructor methods (or the [`qiskit.qasm2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) module), then\n"
"convert that `QuantumCircuit` into a\n"
"[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) with\n"
"[`circuit_to_dag`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/converters#circuit_to_dag).\n"
msgstr ""

