#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.quantum_info {#qiskitquantum-info}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.quantum_info.synthesis` module has been migrated to various\n"
"locations in the codebase, mostly [`qiskit.synthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removed    | Alternative\n"
"-----------|------------\n"
"`OneQubitEulerDecomposer` | [`qiskit.synthesis.one_qubit.OneQubitEulerDecomposer`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.OneQubitEulerDecomposer)\n"
"`TwoQubitBasisDecomposer` | [`qiskit.synthesis.two_qubits.TwoQubitBasisDecomposer`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.TwoQubitBasisDecomposer)\n"
"`XXDecomposer` | [`qiskit.synthesis.two_qubits.XXDecomposer`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.synthesis.XXDecomposer)\n"
"`two_qubit_cnot_decompose` | [`qiskit.synthesis.two_qubits.two_qubit_cnot_decompose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/synthesis#qiskit.synthesis.two_qubit_cnot_decompose)\n"
"`Quaternion` | [`qiskit.quantum_info.Quaternion`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Quaternion)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This move has not affected the usual import path of `Quaternion`, but you can no longer access\n"
"it through `qiskit.quantum_info.synthesis`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, `cnot_rxx_decompose` has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.test\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.test {#qiskittest}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.test` module is no longer a public module.  This was never intended to be public,\n"
"nor to be used outside of the  Qiskit test suite.  All functionality was specific to Qiskit and no\n"
"alternative is provided; if you needed similar functionality, you should include it in your own\n"
"test harnesses.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.tools\"></span>\n"
