#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qiskit.tools {#qiskittools}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools` module was removed in Qiskit v1.0. Most of this functionality was\n"
"either replaced by similar functionality in other packages or removed with no alternative.\n"
"The primary exception is the `qiskit.tools.parallel_map()` function, which has been relocated to\n"
"the [`qiskit.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/utils#parallel_map) module. It can be used\n"
"from this new location instead. For example:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you were previously running:\n"
msgstr ""

