#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "jupyter {#jupyter}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.jupyter` submodule has been removed because the functionality\n"
"in this module is tied to the legacy `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package, which is no\n"
"longer supported. It also only supported `BackendV1` and not the newer\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"monitor\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "monitor {#monitor}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.monitor` submodule has been removed as it was tied to the\n"
"legacy `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package, which is no longer supported (it also\n"
"only supported `BackendV1` interface and not the newer\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) interface). There is\n"
"no alternative provided for this functionality.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"visualization\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "visualization {#visualization}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.visualization` submodule has been removed. This module was a\n"
"legacy redirect from the original location of the Qiskit visualization module and\n"
"was moved to [`qiskit.visualization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization) in Qiskit\n"
"0.8.0. If you're still using this path, update your imports from\n"
"`qiskit.tools.visualization` to\n"
"[`qiskit.visualization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"events\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "events {#events}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `qiskit.tools.events` module and the `progressbar()` utility it exposed\n"
"have been removed. This module's functionality was not widely used and is\n"
"better covered by dedicated packages such as\n"
"[tqdm](https://github.com/tqdm/tqdm).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"qiskit.transpiler\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

